{"skill":{"slug":"klaviyo","displayName":"klaviyo"},"version":{"version":"1.2.8","createdAt":1790938592121,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":83935,"sha256":"4c3153c3d10a998e6e617dbd13ba042bd3bced41512153b6dbd65118eeb60a85","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2087,"sha256":"2993e2798864f4f3a10cbe4ed1f360d4929c9c1e6e7fdbb33e57b96a6a3b6e79","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790939138977,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"0cdf1c5fa43864ea94bdf69957e3e6fc01a93f19f24d1b83fb8d0ba62f67d03b","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/0cdf1c5fa43864ea94bdf69957e3e6fc01a93f19f24d1b83fb8d0ba62f67d03b","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790938911395},"skillspector":{"status":"clean","normalizedStatus":"clean","score":0,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":0,"checkedAt":1790939138977},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This is a disclosed Klaviyo integration that can access and change marketing data, but its sensitive actions are purpose-aligned and require user approval.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access, OAuth login, and a Maton account are necessary for the integration; raw API key use is documented only as a fallback with explicit handling cautions.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Installation uses the Maton CLI via pinned npm or Homebrew instructions, with optional pinned SDKs; this is disclosed and coherent, though users are installing a third-party CLI.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The instructions default to read/list calls, require explicit confirmation for writes, connections, hosted functions, triggers, webhooks, and persistent destinations, and warn against following instructions found in external payloads.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"OAuth tokens, hosted functions, triggers, webhook destinations, and local watch checkpoints can persist beyond a single run, but these behaviors are clearly documented with scoping, approval, and deletion guidance.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill provides broad Klaviyo API access through Maton, including customer profiles, campaigns, flows, templates, webhooks, and bulk subscription operations; this matches the stated email marketing integration purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Install only if you intend to connect Klaviyo through Maton. Use the narrowest OAuth scopes available, prefer read-only operations first, and review carefully before approving writes, campaign sends, bulk consent changes, webhooks, hosted functions, or trigger destinations because those can modify customer data or create ongoing data flows.","findings":null,"agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790939138977}}}}}